    "等比放大到蓋滿螢幕，超出畫面的裁掉。不會有黑邊，但拍到的東西可能被切到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scales up until the screen is covered and crops the overflow. No bars, but part of the frame may be cut off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比放大到盖满屏幕，超出画面的裁掉。不会有黑边，但拍到的东西可能被切到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比放大到蓋滿螢幕，超出畫面的裁掉。不會有黑邊，但拍到的東西可能被切到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等比縮到整支影片都看得見。長寬比跟螢幕不一樣就會留黑邊。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scales down until the whole frame is visible. Leaves bars whenever the aspect ratio differs from the screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比缩到整个视频都看得见。长宽比跟屏幕不一样就会留黑边。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比縮到整支影片都看得見。長寬比跟螢幕不一樣就會留黑邊。"
